    "# Analytical Track Development and Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "## Budget vs Actual Variance Navigator ? PoC #4\n",
    "\n",
    "- Approved track: Track A ? Comparative Intelligence\n",
    "- Dataset: `data/canonical/intelligence_data.csv`\n",
    "- Dataset version: 1.0.0\n",
    "- Analytical method version: 1.0.0\n",
    "- Contract version: 1.0.0\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook documents the reproducible comparative financial analysis, independent validation, and structured output generation.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Scope:** Budget vs Actual comparisons across cost centres, departments, expenditure categories, and monthly reporting periods.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Exclusions:** Predictive modelling, anomaly detection, financial risk scoring, causal inference, and additional datasets."
